		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Skeletal man with a ram's head, wreathed in a cloud of flies. Horseman of Pestilence.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15 (plate mail), <strong>HP</strong> 82, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 scythe +9 (2d4 + soul rot) or 3 longbow (far) +8 (1d8 + soul rot), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +5, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 17</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Soul Rot</strong>. CON 18+ or lose 1d4 CON permanently (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
